# --------------------------------------------------
# | Chronos API base (optional)                    |
# --------------------------------------------------
# The kiosk build is served as static files and calls Chronos by absolute URL,
# so nothing has to proxy /api on the box. Both defaults are fine:
#   dev  (vite):     http://localhost:3001/api
#   build (prod):    https://filc.petrik.hu/api
# Set this only to point a box at a different Chronos, e.g. a staging backend.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001/api
